# Line endings are LF everywhere, whatever core.autocrlf is set to on the machine
# that checked the repository out. The suites match multi-line source patterns
# with \n, and a CRLF checkout made seven of them fail for a reason that had
# nothing to do with the code under test.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.png binary
